[00:00.32]She played the fiddle in an Irish band
{"她曾在爱尔兰乐队演奏小提琴"}
[00:02.86]But she fell in love with an English man
{"却爱上了一个英格兰男人"}
[00:05.47]Kissed her on the neck and then I took her by the hand
{"轻吻她颈侧后牵起她的手"}
[00:07.76]Said baby I just wanna dance
{"说着亲爱的我只想跳舞"}
[00:09.68]I met her on Grafton street right outside of the bar
{"我在酒吧外的格拉夫顿街遇见她"}
[00:12.28]She shared a cigarette with me while her brother played the guitar
{"她与我分享香烟 她兄弟弹着吉他"}
[00:14.83]She asked me what does it mean the Gaelic ink on your arm?
{"她问我手臂上的盖尔语纹身含义"}
[00:16.98]Said it was one of my friend’s songs do you want to drink on?
{"我说是朋友的歌 要再来一杯吗"}
[00:19.67]She took Jamie as a chaser, Jack for the fun
{"她喝杰米追酒 杰克只为尽兴"}
[00:21.98]She got Arthur on the table, with Johnny riding as shot gun
{"亚瑟酒瓶放桌上 强尼坐副驾随行"}
[00:24.59]Chatted some more, one more drink at the bar
{"在酒吧多聊了会 又点了一杯酒"}
[00:26.82]Then put Van on the jukebox, got up to dance, you know
{"点播机放着范的歌 起身跳舞的时候"}
[00:29.37]She played the fiddle in an Irish band
{"她曾在爱尔兰乐队演奏小提琴"}
[00:31.72]But she fell in love with an English man
{"却爱上了一个英格兰男人"}
[00:34.17]Kissed her on the neck and then I took her by the hand
{"轻吻她颈侧后牵起她的手"}
[00:36.61]Said baby I just wanna dance
{"说着亲爱的我只想跳舞"}
[00:38.54]With my pretty little Galway Girl
{"与我可爱的戈尔韦姑娘"}
[00:41.81]My my my my my my my Galway girl
{"我的 我的 我的戈尔韦姑娘"}
[00:48.69]You know she beat me at darts and then she beat me at pool
{"她飞镖赢了我 台球又胜一局"}
[00:51.13]And then she kissed me like there was nobody else in the room
{"随后吻我 仿佛房间只剩我和你"}
[00:53.38]As last orders were called, was when she stood on the stool
{"打烊时分她站上酒吧高凳"}
[00:55.84]After dancing to céili singing to trad tunes
{"跟着传统舞曲欢唱到尽兴"}
[00:58.19]I never heard Carrickfergus ever sung so sweet
{"从未听过如此甜美的卡里克弗格斯"}
[01:00.60]Acapella on the bar using her feet for the beat
{"她在吧台清唱 脚尖打着拍子"}
[01:02.88]Oh I could have that voice playing on repeat for a week
{"这歌声循环一周也不会腻"}
[01:05.28]And in this packed out room, swear she was singing to me，you know
{"在这拥挤的房间里 我确信她正为我歌唱 你懂的"}
